# GraphSlope

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphSlope } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphSlope
  title="example"
  fromLabel="example"
  toLabel="example"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `fromLabel` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `toLabel` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `items` | `SlopeItem[]` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `SlopeItem`
- `GraphSlopeProps`
